:''This article is about the Cat Unit. For the enemy, see [[Kite Cat (Enemy)]].''
'''Vengeful Cat''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked when beating any stage in [[Ghostly Houseguests (Monthly Event)|Ghostly Houseguests]]. It was added in [[Version 2.3 Update#Version 2.3.1 Update|Version 2.3.1]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 5.2 Update|Version 5.2]] increases her attack power and recharge time and gives her the long distance ability. In [[The Battle Cats POP!]], she is unlocked when rolling in the gacha system after clearing [[Moon (Empire of Cats)|Stage 48]] in Chapter 2.

