==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Groucho Cat''' at level 10.

Evolves into '''Kite Cat''' when obtained from the [[Vengeance Awakes!]] (may be dropped on the first stage but guaranteed on the second stage) and is level 20 or above.

==Strategy/Usage==
This unit has horrendous stats and therefore should not be deployed at all, being outclassed by even [[Adult Cat (Rare Cat)|Prisoner Cat]] and [[Red Riding Mina (Special Cat)|Crimson Mina]] as an LD Attacker. However, she does have her uses when it comes to Cat Combos like [[Horror Movies (Combo)|Horror Movies]] and [[Kimono Champs (Combo)|Kimono Champs]].

{{Job|Classification = Combo Slave}}

