==Trivia==
*Her Japanese name (Urameshi nyan) is taken from phrase "urameshiya" that is generally used to act like envious emotion by ghosts, towards humans.
*The Evolved Form's appearance and name are a direct reference to [[wikipedia:Groucho Marx|Groucho Marx]], one of the [[wikipedia:Marx Brothers|Marx Brothers]], a popular family comedy act.
*This character is a variant of [[Actress Cat (Special Cat)|Actress Cat]], so she can combine with [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Sexy Legs Cat]] and its variants ([[Skirt Cat (Special Cat)|Skirt Cat]], [[Panties Cat (Special Cat)|Panties Cat]],...) to look like a whole Cat.
**This is also the case with the Groucho Cat, who gives the Sexy Legs variant below it a pair of groucho glasses.
*Groucho Cat looks like [[mariowiki:Fishing Boo|Fishin' Boo]], an enemy from ''Super Mario World''.
*She is one of the few [[:Category:Zombie Killer Cats|Zombie Killer Cats]] who don't possess any Anti-[[:Category:Zombie Enemies|Zombie]] abilities.

